From 7fd515d62055e67c65fd904d8b32f05dba19223a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erik Berg <fwupd@slipsprogrammor.no>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 01:23:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 18/21] genesys: Add a firmware parser for MStar scaler images

Add a parser for the images used by level 1 MStar scalers. The sBoot
marker identifies the format, the dual-image offset has to agree between
the info block and the updater trailer, the image has to fit inside one
bank, and the CRC-32 the boot loader checks has to match.

The firmware ID is exported but not checked against the panel type the
device reports, as it reads the same in both panel variants of a
release.

Also add a builder file, an oss-fuzz target and a self-test. The
self-test builds an image from the builder file, parses it back, and
checks that an image with a bad CRC is rejected.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
